{"parentUuid":"ed8c9ccb-89fe-463d-b37f-7b37999b7329","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01NqLeqMBXCa2JneeAXNhn67","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Investigation complete. Summary:\n\n**No, Entire's Gemini hook config will not work with Antigravity automatically** — three independent blockers (wrong file path, wrong JSON shape, wrong stdin payload field names).\n\n**Authoritative schema** (from `https://antigravity.google/assets/docs/tools/hooks.md`):\n- File: `<repo>/.agents/hooks.json` or `~/.gemini/config/hooks.json`\n- Top-level keyed by **user-given hook names**, not event names\n- 5 events: `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`, `PreInvocation`, `PostInvocation`, `Stop`\n- Handler fields: `type` (default `\"command\"`), `command`, `timeout`\n- Stdin keys are **camelCase**: `conversationId`, `workspacePaths`, `transcriptPath`, `toolCall.{name,args}`, `stepIdx`, `fullyIdle`, etc.\n\n**Implications for the long-term shared-config vision**: it's not literally one file shared — it's a sibling agent (`agent/antigravity/`) with its own installer, its own `entire hooks antigravity <event>` subcommand family, and a different event mapping (notably **no SessionStart** in Antigravity; needs lazy-init on first event). When Gemini CLI deprecates, alias `gemini-cli` → `antigravity` in `registry.go`. Saved as project memory so future sessions don't redo this research.\n\nHolding implementation per your instruction. Ready when you want to start the `antigravity/` agent package.\n\nSources:\n- [Antigravity Hooks documentation](https://antigravity.google/docs/hooks) (fetched via `/assets/docs/tools/hooks.md`)\n- [Google Developers Blog: transitioning Gemini CLI to Antigravity CLI](https://developers.googleblog.com/an-important-update-transitioning-gemini-cli-to-antigravity-cli/)\n- [I/O 2026 developer highlights](https://blog.google/innovation-and-ai/technology/developers-tools/google-io-2026-developer-highlights/)\n- [context-mode platform-support](https://github.com/mksglu/context-mode/blob/main/docs/platform-support.md) (note: pre-2.0; incorrectly states \"Antigravity does not support hooks\" — outdated as of 2026-05-19)"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":656,"cache_read_input_tokens":165610,"output_tokens":802,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":656,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":802,"cache_read_input_tokens":165610,"cache_creation_input_tokens":656,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":656},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CbCXaoZthzi84yCb7Znk5","type":"assistant","uuid":"335cf518-b86f-4043-b6e3-7a77b19e70d1","timestamp":"2026-05-19T20:05:23.341Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/peytonmontei/Documents/entire/devenv/entireio/cli","sessionId":"27c10fbd-3055-4d96-8e88-8a95ee2d9e1e","version":"2.1.144","gitBranch":"main"}
