bagents available) or superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan. Steps use checkbox (`- [ ]`) syntax for tracking.\n\n**Goal:** Add Antigravity CLI as a first-class agent in `cmd/entire/cli/agent/antigravity/`, peer to `geminicli`, implementing the `Agent` + `HookSupport` interfaces.\n\n**Architecture:** New agent package registers via `agent.Register(agent.AgentNameAntigravity, NewAntigravityAgent)`. Implements `HookSupport.ParseHookEvent` to translate Antigravity's 5 native hook events into Entire's normalized `EventType` lifecycle (TurnStart / TurnEnd / SessionEnd / ToolUse — no SessionStart in v1; see \"Deferred\" below). Hook config writes to `<repo>/.agents/hooks.json` (the example workspace path documented in Antigravity's hooks doc). Stdin payloads are camelCase — a separate parser from Gemini's snake_case schema. Antigravity has no SessionStart hook, so `parsePreInvocation` always emits `TurnStart`; `strategy.InitializeSession` is idempotent and is called from the framework's TurnStart handler (`cli/lifecycle.go:406`), which initializes session state on first arrival. `transcriptPath` is read directly from each payload (no discovery dance).\n\n**Tech Stack:** Go 1.26.x, cobra, go-git, existing `agent.HookSupport` interface (`agent.go:88-110`), `strategy.InitializeSession`/`LoadSessionState` (`strategy/manual_commit_hooks.go:2231`, `strategy/session_state.go:50`), `paths.WorktreeRoot(ctx)`, `agent.IsManagedHookCommand`.\n\n**Phasing:**\n- **v1 (this plan):** Agent skeleton with full `Agent` + `HookSupport` surface; install/uninstall `.agents/hooks.json`; route 5 events through `ParseHookEvent` into normalized lifecycle events; capture file changes from `PreToolUse`; condense on `Stop` with `fullyIdle=true`. Transcript stub returns the raw JSONL bytes from `transcriptPath`; on-disk schema verified by captured fixture before any decoder logic ships.\n- **Deferred (separate plans):** Antigravity-specific transcript decoder (token counting, file-change 